
LVS:
1. After cdl out, customer need to run chg_netlist.pl program.
path:      /perl/chg_netlist.pl
command:  ./chg_netlist.pl <your_netlist_file.cdl>

2. Use new netlist_lvs to run calibre LVS.

3. When customer use serial resistance on schematic, customer need to modify calibre LVS command rule file option for serial resistance LVS.

LVS REDUCE SERIES RESISTORS ""YES"

DRC:
Depend on different top metal thickness, customer need to add dummy layer on chip.


Symbol label display issue:
  When you change the property value in Virtuoso replace,
  the value of symbol label is not changed.

1. Load the code via the CIW:
   load("./perl/CCSinvokeCdfCallbacks.il")

2. Open the schematic.

3. Type this command via the CIW:
   CCSinvokeCdfCallbacks(geGetEditCellView() ?callInitProc t ?useInstCDF t)




